## chart main MMDX Registry Audit Map
```mermaid
quadrantChart
  title MMDX Registry Audit Map
  x-axis Local file issue --> Registry or placement issue
  y-axis Low decision impact --> Blocks current evidence
  "HIGH Stale index": [0.76, 0.9]
  "MED Link drift": [0.48, 0.68]
  "OK Valid stack": [0.17, 0.25]
  "Plan First fixes": [0.68, 0.52]
```

## chart stale-index Stale Index Detail
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  files["Active .mmdx files"]
  index["INDEX.mmdx"]
  mtime{"Index newer than active files?"}
  stale["HIGH stale index"]
  refresh["Run mmdx_index.py"]
  verify["Open or preflight refreshed INDEX.mmdx"]
  files --> index --> mtime
  mtime --> stale --> refresh --> verify
```

## chart link-drift Link Drift Detail
```mermaid
flowchart LR
  meta["MMDX link metadata"]
  chart["Declared chart ids"]
  labels["Visible labels in source chart"]
  files["Local .mmd or .mmdx links"]
  drift["MED link drift"]
  meta --> chart --> drift
  meta --> labels --> drift
  files --> drift
```

## chart valid-stack Valid Stack Proof
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  source["Read active MMDX source"]
  links["Check metadata links"]
  preflight["mmd.py --preflight-only"]
  placement["Confirm owner path"]
  proof["OK valid stack proof"]
  source --> links --> preflight --> placement --> proof
```

## chart first-fixes First Fixes
```mermaid
gantt
  title MMDX Registry First Fixes
  dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD
  axisFormat  %m-%d
  section Audit
  Run read-only scanner             :a1, 2026-05-10, 1d
  Refresh generated index if needed :a2, after a1, 1d
  Preflight active stacks           :a3, after a2, 1d
  section Fix
  Patch missing chart links         :b1, after a3, 1d
  Move misplaced active trackers    :b2, after b1, 1d
  Verify current evidence path      :b3, after b2, 1d
```
